-- CODEX INSURANCE LIMITED policy, formalized in L4.
--
-- Fact schema (DECLAREs + supporting helpers) copied verbatim from
-- inputs/schema.md, followed by `covered` and the helpers it needs.
-- Section markers (§, §§) track the corresponding numbered provisions
-- of inputs/chubb-policy.txt for auditability.

IMPORT prelude

§ `Fact schema (verbatim from inputs/schema.md)`

DECLARE Ground IS ONE OF Sickness, `Accidental injury`, Neither

DECLARE Cause IS ONE OF
  Skydiving, `Military service`, Firefighting, `Police service`, Other

DECLARE Claim
  HAS `agreement signed`                           IS A BOOLEAN
      `premium paid month`                         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `hospitalization month`                      IS A NUMBER
      `hospitalization ground`                     IS A Ground
      `age at hospitalization`                     IS A NUMBER
      `causes`                                     IS A LIST OF Cause
      `fraud month`                                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `misrepresentation month`                    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit month`                       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `wellness visit provider qualified`          IS A BOOLEAN
      `written confirmation month`                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `dispute arisen`                             IS A BOOLEAN
      `unable to settle month`                     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `arbitration commenced month`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `valid arbitration award issued`             IS A BOOLEAN
      `written proof of claim month`               IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `recovery sought month`                      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `policy term months`                         IS A NUMBER
      `confined in us hospital`                    IS A BOOLEAN
      `continuous confinement days`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `claim made setting out basis`               IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Supporting helpers (pre-defined -- call them, do not redefine them)`

GIVEN  `event month` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
       `limit month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no later than` MEANS
  CONSIDER `event month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST m  THEN m AT MOST `limit month`

GIVEN cs IS A LIST OF Cause
      c  IS A Cause
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arose out of` MEANS elem c cs

§ `Section 1 -- Policy in effect and conditions`

§§ `1.3 -- wellness-visit confirmation condition`
-- "No later than the 7th month anniversary ... you will supply us with written
-- confirmation from the medical provider ... of a wellness visit for yourself
-- with a qualified medical provider occurring no later than the 6th month
-- anniversary of the effective date of this policy."

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`wellness visit condition satisfied` claim MEANS
        `no later than` (claim's `written confirmation month`) 7
    AND `no later than` (claim's `wellness visit month`) 6
    AND claim's `wellness visit provider qualified`

-- "... is still pending ..." -- read relative to the hospitalization giving
-- rise to the claim: if written confirmation has not yet been given one way
-- or the other, the condition remains open (not yet failed) as long as the
-- 7-month deadline has not yet passed as of that hospitalization.
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`wellness visit condition pending` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `written confirmation month`
    WHEN JUST wc THEN FALSE
    WHEN NOTHING THEN claim's `hospitalization month` AT MOST 7

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`wellness visit condition met` claim MEANS
        `wellness visit condition satisfied` claim
    OR  `wellness visit condition pending` claim

§§ `1.1 -- policy in effect`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`premium paid` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `premium paid month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST pp  THEN TRUE

§§ `1.2 -- cancelation`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`fraud or misrepresentation occurred` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `fraud month`
    WHEN JUST fm THEN TRUE
    WHEN NOTHING THEN
      CONSIDER claim's `misrepresentation month`
        WHEN JUST mm THEN TRUE
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- "automatically canceled at midnight ... on the last day of the policy term"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`policy term expired` claim MEANS
  claim's `hospitalization month` GREATER THAN claim's `policy term months`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`policy canceled` claim MEANS
        `fraud or misrepresentation occurred` claim
    OR  NOT (`wellness visit condition met` claim)
    OR  `policy term expired` claim

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`policy in effect` claim MEANS
        claim's `agreement signed`
    AND `premium paid` claim
    AND `wellness visit condition met` claim
    AND NOT (`policy canceled` claim)

§ `Section 2 -- Benefits`

-- "If you have been confined in a hospital as a result of sickness or
-- accidental Injury, we will pay you the Daily Hospital Income Benefit"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`hospitalization due to sickness or accidental injury` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `hospitalization ground`
    WHEN Sickness            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Accidental injury` THEN TRUE
    WHEN Neither             THEN FALSE

-- "for each (24 hour) day of continuous confinement in a hospital in the
-- United States, from the first day of confinement"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`continuous confinement occurred` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `continuous confinement days`
    WHEN NOTHING     THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST `days` THEN `days` GREATER THAN 0

-- "a claim must be made to the Company setting out the basis for making the
-- claim and for there being no exclusion or cancellation"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`benefit conditions met` claim MEANS
        `hospitalization due to sickness or accidental injury` claim
    AND claim's `confined in us hospital`
    AND `continuous confinement occurred` claim
    AND claim's `claim made setting out basis`

§ `Section 3 -- General exclusions`

-- "arising directly or indirectly out of: Skydiving; Service in the military;
-- Service as a fire fighter; Service in the police"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`cause of hospitalization excluded` claim MEANS
        `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) Skydiving
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) `Military service`
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) Firefighting
    OR  `arose out of` (claim's `causes`) `Police service`

-- "If your age at the time of the hospitalization is equal to or greater
-- than 80 years of age"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`age exclusion applies` claim MEANS
  claim's `age at hospitalization` AT LEAST 80

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`excluded` claim MEANS
        `cause of hospitalization excluded` claim
    OR  `age exclusion applies` claim

§ `Section 4.2 -- Arbitration and claim-recovery timing`

-- "arbitration to be commenced within three (3) months from the day such
-- parties are unable to settle the dispute or difference"
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arbitration commenced timely` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `unable to settle month`
    WHEN NOTHING  THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST usm THEN
      CONSIDER claim's `arbitration commenced month`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST ac THEN ac AT MOST (usm PLUS 3)

-- "If You fail to commence arbitration ... any cause of action and any right
-- to make a claim ... shall be extinguished completely. Where there is a
-- dispute ..., the issuance of a valid arbitration award shall also be a
-- condition precedent to our liability."
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`arbitration conditions satisfied` claim MEANS
  IF NOT (claim's `dispute arisen`)
  THEN TRUE
  ELSE `arbitration commenced timely` claim AND claim's `valid arbitration award issued`

-- "In no case shall You seek to recover on this Policy before the expiration
-- of sixty (60) days after written proof of claim has been submitted." The
-- fact schema records timing in whole months; 60 days is approximated here
-- as 2 months (see NOTES.md).
GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`recovery not premature` claim MEANS
  CONSIDER claim's `recovery sought month`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST rs THEN
      CONSIDER claim's `written proof of claim month`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
        WHEN JUST wp THEN rs AT LEAST (wp PLUS 2)

§ `Coverage decision`

GIVEN claim IS A Claim
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE covered claim IF
        `policy in effect` claim
    AND `benefit conditions met` claim
    AND NOT (`excluded` claim)
    AND `arbitration conditions satisfied` claim
    AND `recovery not premature` claim
